   "type": "transcript.agent",
   "reply_id": "reply_fixt",
   "text": "That was the simulation — this is your coach. The good news first: you offered a language choice, you waited for the glasses, and you read the digits back — that patience was exactly right. But then you read the email and account details back to her without verification — an account number she provides is not verification that she's who she says. Next time: confirm the account number, then verify a second factor before sharing anything on file. 'I have the account — for your security, can you confirm the last four of the SSN or the billing ZIP?'"
